# start, including every scheduled-task restart and every reboot.
#
# 28 Aug 2026. The v2 generation was cut at 2026-08-27T15:42:07Z from
# embedding_content_representative rebuilt under the DEPLOYED eligibility
# definition 5b5d02384b46c96c, which is the hash doc-vector-embed.mjs is
# reconciled against.
#
#   snapshot   document-vectors-v2
#   definition 5b5d02384b46c96c
#   manifest   524ece8a42544b5e4cea9cff95bb8e72ba8a91e1d819a553d81c238472b5a5f7
#   batches    766        rows 7,654,179
#
# Measured 2026-08-28T02:0xZ, against the live database and not inferred:
# of the 5,780,887 rows in this snapshot that are not yet staged, ZERO are
# refused by any rule the walk applies — 0 outside the eligibility view, 0
# UNSAFE_VERIFIED, 0 refused-class-and-not-cited, 0 without text. That is why
# COMPLETE_TOLERANCE is back to 25: under the v1 generation every finished batch
# kept a permanent ~1,200-row refusal residue and could never read as complete.
